"A living person on Earth with no record of birth or arrival is an anomaly the System flags."
"The network's machine voice gives the System's answers; the Contract does not speak to her itself."
"The System takes no request for affixation outside selection, and says so plainly."
"It makes no contract of silence by telephone and does not bargain with an unregistered caller."
"A claim of passing through chaos makes the System order a chaos screening before anything else."
"It tells such a caller to stay where she is, and notifies the nearest consulate's Artonan staff."
"The call is logged under her name, and her sigil stays on the lobby phone."
"Nala carries no chaos corruption; a screening finds none."
